    <div class="han-t">刑天 · Xíngtiān — the headless god who would not fall</div>
    <p class="lead">They cut off his head and buried it inside a mountain so deep he could never find it again. It did not stop him. He grew a face on his chest, picked his weapons back up, and kept swinging — and two thousand years later, he still hasn't stopped.</p>
